      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALWAYSATTHEBEACH (9) has been a bit hot and cold and that continued last start when she finished second, beaten a head, in a better performance at Albury over 1770m. Hard to know where she gets from this slightly awkward draw. Taking on a better line-up this time but she is up to the challenge. ALABAMA LIONESS (8) made it two wins on the bounce at her latest appearance over 1720m at this track, scoring by 11 metres after taking charge a long way from home. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Needs to be at her best to beat this field but she has the ability to mix it with them. LESSISMORE (3) is better than her last-start run for eighth over 1740m at Riverina Paceway. Worth another chance. ALWAYS BE BRENDAN (2) ended last prep with a seventh at Riverina Paceway over 2270m three-and-a-half months ago. Can open this campaign with a more positive effort.",
